# Influora Motion (always-on for src/)

## Stack

React 19 · Vite · Tailwind 4 · Framer Motion · R3F · Lilac Mist (`#9b8cf2`, `#f0ebfa`)

## Before animating

1. Check motion level in `docs/react/INFLUORA-3D-MOTION-BLUEPRINT.md`
2. Reuse `@/components/motion` — do not reinvent FadeUp/Stagger
3. Chat/deals = Level 0–1, no 3D, no message stagger

## Emil rules

- `active:scale-[0.97]` on buttons — never `transition-all`
- `ease-out` only — never `ease-in`
- `useReducedMotion()` on every animation
- Max 3 R3F canvases: auth, discover hero, public portfolio

## Vite (not Next.js)

- Lazy: `React.lazy()` + `Suspense`
- Routes: `useLocation()` from react-router-dom

